 right panel, as a member who holds history.read.","The base state is a View with a history of autosaves, Checkpoints, a change made outside UIUX and a restore, listed in two day groups: Today and Yesterday.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the column is the panel content, about 340px wide in the Workbench."],"intent":"Show the History panel of the View page (the right panel with ?panel=history) as built from Adapter Widgets only: the versions that changed this View, newest first and grouped by day, with Create Checkpoint above.","interactionRules":["Each row names its kind (autosave, Checkpoint, changed outside UIUX, system change), its time, who made it and how many resources it changed; a Checkpoint also shows its note.","A row opens its comparison with the version before it (the compare button) or, once a version is selected, a comparison with the selected one; the chevron expands the changed resources and the write events.","Consecutive autosaves with no net change collapse into one row that expands to its autosaves.","A restore names the version it restored from, or says the source is no longer in history; a version that may miss changes says so.","Create Checkpoint is offered on tablet and desktop, never on a phone; without history.read the panel names the missing key instead of the list."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the four core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"}],"requirements":["01a11a5e-1aa5-7d13-939a-8d99245f7906","01a11a5e-1946-7217-aff5-db13df3a2977","01a11a5d-fe15-7ed2-ab74-4616dcc47a28","01a11a5e-0919-73d1-9082-cd17a275da0c","01a11a5e-0c71-78d1-9adb-14db6c67ab9c","01a11a5e-1ba5-765e-966f-a681def5f472","01a11a5e-0b79-7920-953b-288cede75df8"]},"variants":{"load-more":{"state":{"day-older-wrap":{"visible":true},"more":{"visible":true}}},"no-read-key":{"requi